      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-09-21T01:15:12.559Z",
      "description": "A vulnerability has been found in RooCMS up to 1.2.2/1.3.4/1.4RC2. This impacts the function eval of the file roocms/site_pagePHP.php of the component Frontend Rendering. Such manipulation of the argument content leads to code injection. The attack can be launched remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.",
      "severity": 4.7,
